eamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706680918","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:48:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4838130-1846018067934962","game_id":"steam-4838130","kind":"update","title":"Edge of the Blade — Demo Update & First Look at Story Mode","summary":"Edge of the Blade — Steam Next Fest Demo Update & First Look at Story Mode Hello, this is NINEHECTARE! Steam Next Fest is just around the corner for Edge of the Blade. The new demo we're bringing to the festival includes a first look at Story Mode, along with optimization work, new graphical assets, and many other improvements. ■ Demo Improvements Tighter Playtime — We've trimmed the demo so you can experience the core fun in about 10 turns. Clearer Goals — Quests and victory objectives are now ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T00:00:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934962","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:48:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4838130-1842846814446031","game_id":"steam-4838130","kind":"announcement","title":"Edge of the Blade — Demo Arrives September 7, Playtest Concluded","summary":"Hello, this is NINEHECTARE.Originally set to end on August 18, the playtest was extended by about two weeks,and the 4-week Edge of the Blade Steam Playtest has now come to a close.Around 270 players took part in this test and sent us a wealth of feedbackon combat and strategy systems, UI, balance, bugs, and much more.We've fixed a number of issues based on what you reported,and we're still refining combat and the overall quality of the game.To everyone who joined the playtest and shared your val","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T10:37:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externa